        "text": "Immune to Nullify, Fateseal and Stagger effects."
      },
      {
        "id": "ability-record-84337",
        "links": [],
        "text": "An enhanced immune system provides full immunity to the Poisons of the Battlerealm."
      },
      {
        "id": "ability-record-84338",
        "links": [
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "1,525.2"
