          },
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "6"
          }
        ],
        "text": "When the Opponent gains a Bar of Power gain an indefinite Gamma Power granting 1,525.2 Attack Rating and 17% Potency of his personal Debuffs from Specials. Max 6 Stacks."
      },
      {
        "id": "ability-record-84340",
        "links": [
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "3"
          },
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "3.33"
          },
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "50"
          }
        ],
        "text": "At 3 or more Stacks of Gamma Power, after launching a Special consumes all stacks and activates Cosmic Mode, lasting 3.33 second(s) per Gamma Power, but it is paused during Specials from the Overseer or the Opponent. Cosmic Mode lasts 50% longer for Defenders."
      },
      {
        "id": "ability-record-84343",
        "links": [
          {
            "expanded": "false",
            "text": "2,542"
          }
        ],
        "text": "For each Gamma Power gained while in Cosmic Mode, instead gain a non-stacking Fury Buff granting 2,542 Attack Rating per Gamma Power used to enter the mode, with its total duration equalling its Cosmic Mode starting duration."
      },
      {
        "id": "ability-record-84344",
        "links": [
          {
            "expanded": "false",
